stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: Création de l'enchère
    
    Active --> EndedAwaitingFinalization: Fin de l'enchère
    EndedAwaitingFinalization --> Pending: Démarrage finalisation
    
    Pending --> PaymentPending: Gagnant désigné
    Pending --> Failed: Aucune enchère
    
    PaymentPending --> PaymentSuccessful: Paiement réussi
    PaymentPending --> PaymentFailed: Échec paiement
    PaymentPending --> AdminReview: Timeout
    
    PaymentFailed --> PaymentPending: Nouvelle tentative (< 3)
    PaymentFailed --> Pending: Sélection nouveau gagnant (≥ 3)
    PaymentFailed --> Failed: Aucun autre gagnant
    
    PaymentSuccessful --> RewardsTransferred: Attribution récompenses
    RewardsTransferred --> Completed: Finalisation complète
    
    AdminReview --> Pending: Admin résolution
    AdminReview --> PaymentSuccessful: Admin skip paiement
    AdminReview --> Failed: Admin marque échec
    
    Failed --> [*]
    Completed --> [*]
